gerous dragon. Bilbo reluctantly joins their quest, unaware that on his journey to the Lonely Mountain he will encounter both a magic ring and a frightening creature known as Gollum.\r\n(back cover)"}, "publish_places": ["Boston"], "number_of_pages": 300, "source_records": ["bwb:9780547928227"], "latest_revision": 9, "revision": 9, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2021-09-26T14:35:40.276435"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2024-09-18T11:15:30.969568"}}}}}, "items": [{"enumcron": false, "match": "similar", "status": "lendable", "fromRecord": "/books/OL33891995M", "ol-edition-id": "OL30561216M", "ol-work-id": "OL27482W", "publishDate": "2017", "contributor": "", "itemURL": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL30561216M/El_Hobbit/borrow", "cover": {"small": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/14625970-S.jpg", "medium": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/14625970-M.jpg", "large": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/14625970-L.jpg"}}, {"enumcron": false, "match": "similar", "status": "lendable", "fromRecord": "/books/OL33891995M", "ol-edition-id": "OL32760447M", "ol-work-id": "OL27482W", "publishDate": "2007", "contributor": "", "itemURL": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL32760447M/Hobbit/borrow", "cover": {"small": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/11387212-S.jpg", "medium": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/11387212-M.jpg", "large": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/11387212-L.jpg"}}, {"enumcron": false, "match": "similar", "status": "lendable", "fromRecord": "/books/OL33891995M", "ol-edition-id": "OL31935416M", "ol-work-id": "OL27482W", "publishDate": "2007", "contributor": "", "itemURL": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL31935416M/El_Hobbit/borrow", "cover": {"small": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15146094-S.jpg", "medium": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15146094-M.jpg", "large": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15146094-L.jpg"}}, {"enumcron": false, "match": "similar", "status": "lendable", "fromRecord": "